  <item>
    <title>1.在北方滩涂纵火，成为人形快门，我与海岸线的羁绊。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6600cac02d9eae5d0ac9eab6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6600cac02d9eae5d0ac9eab6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 25 Mar 2024 00:52:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>唐城，摄影新手</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="16">00:16</a> 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 关于海岸线的新系列节目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a> 同样拍过海岸线的人，传统公路摄影，以及挖坑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">06:24</a> 聊海岸线时我实际在分享什么 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 童年时代的海岸环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1177">19:37</a> 纵火一时爽，一直纵火一直爽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a> 童年看海感觉，岸线面貌的变化，以及后劲儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1749">29:09</a> 我对海岸线的好奇之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1867">31:07</a> 2017年，第一次跑海岸线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2054">34:14</a> 2019年，第二次跑海岸线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2186">36:26</a> 2021年，第三次跑海岸线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2354">39:14</a> 关于照片主线的构思 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2678">44:38</a> 海岸线观察；1.填海造陆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2899">48:19</a> 海岸线观察；2.滨海雕像&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> 海岸线观察；3.假热带植物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3085">51:25</a> 关于照片如何呈现&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3305">55:05</a> 下期预告</span></p><span></span><p><span>【相关影像】</span></p><span></span><p><span>▼北方海岸滩涂面貌，芦苇与碱蓬草（2023）。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Floc60jy5pMn-0mR9kmqYXMHzK1I.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>▼2017年，老父亲给我在淘宝买的摩托车拆箱，本想就此出发浪迹天涯，没想到光办理增驾就用光了一个月假期。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lg-ONIvqfuduLPpSITIaZC9ZcEhV.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>▼2019年，春节骑车从北京回老家，手机拍摄海岸线影像。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpFOf-ifoCF8GtG8QQ5CerEMab6h.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqoPlI4ryfrdtsNU6arv0bzXzl25.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>▼2021年，再次上路时的座驾。本想就此出发浪迹天涯，没想到只顾着骑车，根本停不下来拍照。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljS13-8ZEENGvs3cUoFMKFkWV6gQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>▼2021年，海岸线短暂行程中拍摄的影像，更加坚定了之后要走完的决心。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltpI7skiuAOgO6CKkKG6tAgf9X4m.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgZVbvQJRgp7Ba0gDm5E1aB0sSyp.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqwxCNSvCnVbBEnlVBZ9qvvXx2zS.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>▼海岸线观察。辽宁省东港市，菩萨庙镇，大犽虎坨子。原本的离岸岛，目前已经通过道路跟大陆直接连接。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlaUai4X_LWG_BCDQdKcF8vxJqYj.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgsPQVrjzehx25mXbrepun7PK03S.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>▼海岸线观察。关于岸线纪念物。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlVJYg32i_g-QHDx1OHVs1aTWE1s.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>▼海岸线观察。关于假椰子树假棕榈树。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrCiW7VpXSq14DsNqtgm5zwoUFkq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>▼2024海岸线主线（局部）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuZvL0ekVM87QFM9MQVYwvfD2d6I.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《某日》－ 文雀</span></p><span></span><p><span>【一起聊天】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq7c_auHv4Vfy2dE7y4YQUSJLVLj.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lslpECAKDA1tr0szZtnWPir5ujZM.m4a" length="49695844" type="audio/mp4"/>
