  <item>
    <title>0.喂，喜欢摄影的人，我们交个朋友呗！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f1ec4b696bd9a879086148</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f1ec4b696bd9a879086148</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Mar 2024 18:11:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期内容】</span></p><p><span>主播小唐掏心掏肺，讲点自己的故事，想跟你交个朋友。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a> 片儿汤话</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="184">03:04</a> 我和播客之间，有点不得不说的故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="486">08:06</a> 这个播客是想咋搞？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1117">18:37</a> 起了个什么破名字？！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1547">25:47</a> 弄个播客图啥？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1721">28:41</a> 【我的故事】古早人人网时期</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2206">36:46</a> 【我的故事】开店注定失败</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a> 【我的故事】颠去异国，不耽误失败</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2684">44:44</a> 【我的故事】莫名其妙，入职字节</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3117">51:57</a> 【我的故事】上班狂看私房照，究竟为哪般？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3559">59:19</a> 【我的故事】莫名其妙的金融履历</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4016">66:56</a> 结个尾 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>【主播】</span></p><p><span>唐城：新手，刚开始学照相，大佬求带。</span></p><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><p><span>《youth》— Fayzz</span></p><p><span>【群二维码】</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpV7N1aoDBiT3v_mr3QLmusZG8hJ.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
